            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed is a sensor-processing system including, in some embodiments, a sensor, one or more sample pre-processing modules, one or more sample-processing modules, one or more neuromorphic integrated circuits ("ICs"), and a microcontroller. The one or more sample pre-processing modules are configured to process raw sensor data for use in the sensor-processing system. The one or more sample-processing modules are configured to process pre-processed sensor data including extracting features from the pre-processed sensor data. Each of the neuromorphic ICs includes at least one neural network configured to arrive at actionable decisions of the neural network from the features extracted from the pre-processed sensor data. The microcontroller includes a CPU along with memory including instructions for operating the sensor-processing system. In some embodiments, the sensor is a pulse-density modulation ("PDM") microphone, and the sensor-processing system is configured for keyword spotting. Also disclosed are methods of such a keyword spotting sensor-processing system.</p>
            </abstract>
